+//! Reached product representation control and owned numerical operations.
+//!
+//! This first phase owns ordinary representation/item admission in both product
+//! consumers. Mapping, boolean, layer and opening child control remains synchronous
+//! in its existing owners; this module does not claim transport or resource safety.
+
+mod traversal;
